Prompts: Approval Workflow

Purpose:
  Human approval workflow for role assignments and provisioning.

Owns: ./

ReadOrder:
   1  @INDEX.sdd
   2  @approval-workflow.sdd
   3  @human-approval.sdd

Modes:
  PROPOSE  — AI proposes role assignments
  REVIEW   — human reviews proposals
  APPROVE  — human approves
  REJECT   — human rejects with feedback
  REVISE   — AI revises based on feedback

Rules:
  [AW1] Role assignments MUST be approved before provisioning.
  [AW2] Production deployments ALWAYS require explicit approval.
  [AW3] Multiple approvers MAY be required for critical systems.
  [AW4] Approval decisions MUST be recorded in audit log.
  [AW5] Rejected proposals MUST include revision feedback.
  [AW6] Approval timeout MUST be configurable per case.

Entry:
  Read:
    INDEX.sdd
    approval-workflow.sdd

  Resolve:
    approval-workflow
    human-approval

Navigation:
  ApprovalWorkflow: @prompts/role-assignment/approval-workflow.sdd
  HumanApproval: @prompts/role-assignment/human-approval.sdd

State: +
